blocks.en:
Our design is motivated by three observations:
(1) Most CHDs are presented as cardiac structural anomalies. Semantic masks therefore provide an explicit and interpretable representation of cardiac anatomy and morphology, as a unified proxy for CHD analysis;
(2) Semantic masks provide dense, fine-grained spatial control and can be manipulated easily, flexibly, and reliably, which enables CHD simulation with anatomical consistency according to clinical priors;
(3) Counterfactual masks offer explicit references for verifying the anatomical correctness of synthesized samples while supplying pixel-level supervision for downstream tasks at no extra annotation cost.

blocks.zh:
我们的设计基于三个观察:
(1) 多数 CDD被表述为心脏结构异常. 因此,语义口罩为心脏解剖学和形态学提供了明确和可解释的表述,是CHD分析的统一代用;
(2) 语义口罩提供密集、精细的空间控制,并且可以容易、灵活和可靠地被操纵,从而能够根据临床前科进行具有解剖一致性的CHD模拟;
(3)反事实口罩为验证合成样品的解剖正确性提供明确参考,同时为下游任务提供像素级监督,不增加注释费用.
